79;2011;%4Undock skid (%1) activated and both switches (%2) are occupied.;Switch position is not permissible during this activation.;- Check pressure supply%CrLf%- Check docking and undocking valves for pressure and wear%CrLf%- Check pressure switch for docking and undocking valves%CrLf%- Drive linear unit manually into a defined state
79;2012;%4Dock skid (%1) activated and both switches (%2) are occupied.;Switch position is not permissible during this activation.;- Check pressure supply%CrLf%- Check docking and undocking valves for pressure and wear%CrLf%- Check pressure switch for docking and undocking valves%CrLf%- Drive linear unit manually into a defined state
79;2013;%4Dock skid (%1) activated and switch %2 is occupied.;Switch position is not permissible during this activation.;- Check pressure supply%CrLf%- Check docking and undocking valves for pressure and wear%CrLf%- Check pressure switch for docking and undocking valves%CrLf%- Drive linear unit manually into a defined state
79;2014;%4Undock skid (%1) activated and only switch %2 is occupied.;Switch position is not permissible during this activation.;- Check pressure supply%CrLf%- Check docking and undocking valves for pressure and wear%CrLf%- Check pressure switch for docking and undocking valves%CrLf%- Drive linear unit manually into a defined state
