100;1;%4Strobes from PLC not clear;Strobe signals of PLC do not correspond to the conventions;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
100;2;%4NAck for Body Strobe;Car body cannot be booked in (car body data invalid or FiFo full);Delete station (Clear FiFo) and continue. Contact control supplier in case of reappearance
100;3;%4Body %1 not found ;A car body cannot be found in the FiFo;Delete station (Clear FiFo) and continue. Contact control supplier in case of reappearance
100;4;%4Fifo full%1  ;FiFo is full, no further car body can be booked in;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
100;5;%4No car body at zone inlet in Fifo%1 ;The BCU sent a new object to the TriggerBrush (aEvtRxNewBody) but the body ID is 0. The ID must be unequal 0, however.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
100;7;%4Paint program is currently running and body data in the zone changed.;During Motion active, an attempt was made to change the body data in the zone;Get in contact with control supplier.
100;8;%4No car body is present in the zone and BodyInPosition received.;logical error in the PLC interface;Get in contact with control supplier.
100;9;%4BodyInPosition received and moer than one body in zone;Internal control problem, programming error or parameterizing error.;Get in contact with control supplier.
100;10;%4Car body %1 is at the TrackingEndPosition, although statistics or postprocess not finished;TrackingEndPosition is not correctly parameterized;Correct TrackingEndPosition
100;11;%4Robot active without active atomizer;The robot was selected, the atomizer is unselected, however;Select atomizer
