116;1;%4Color cannot be set manually. Channel not purged. ;It was attempted to reselect a color from the hmi system. This is only permissible if the channel is purged.;Purge channel
116;2;%4Invalid color %1 reselected. Min: %2, Max: %3 ;It was attempted to reselect a paint. The desired paint number is invalid, however.;Reselect color once again. Check interface. Check vision system.
116;3;%4Color cannot be reselected. Channel occupied. ;It was attempted to reselect a paint. This is not possible, however, because the channel is occupied by another entity (for example time program active).;Wait until time program has ended.
116;4;%4Invalid valve %1 reselected. Min: %2, Max: %3 ;It was attempted to reselect a paint. The desired valve is invalid, however.;Reselect color once again. Check interface. Check vision system.
116;7;%4Invalid supply group %1 reselected. Min: %2, Max: %3   ;It was attempted to reselect a color that contains an invalid paint supply group.;Check color assignment table and adjust where appropriate, download again, reselect again.
