116;12;%4Component color %1 includes no or an invalid supply group. ;An invalid component number has been entered in the component table.;Check color assignment table and adjust where appropriate, download again, reselect again.
116;13;%4No assignment found.;An invalid component number has been entered in the component table.;Check color assignment table and adjust where appropriate, download again, reselect again.
116;14;%4Reselected color %1 does not belong to the appendant supply group.;A color was reselected. This color does not appertain to the supply group of the paint color changer, however.;Check color assignment table and adjust where appropriate, download again, reselect again.
