150;7;%4Assigned pump %1 for device %2 not found.;In the parameter "AssignedPumpName" of the process.cfg, a wrong device name was configured for the dosing pump;Check and correct parameters in the process.cfg
150;8;%4Turbine collision speed slump: %1 (max: %2) in %3;A speed decrease above the parameterized limit value of the turbine was found. Presumably a collision has occurred.;Please check the turbine and the proper fixing of the bell disk.
150;10;%4Turbine blockade speed slump : %1 (max: %2) in %3;A speed decrease above the parameterized limit value of the turbine was found. Presumably a collision has occurred.;Please check the turbine and the proper fixing of the bell disk.
150;11;%4Invalid cycle time for algorithm to simulate motor air determined;The values for the simulation of the air volume regulator in file Process.cfg are not available or were parameterized wrongly.;Correct simulation values in the Process.cfg file.
150;12;%4Opening file %1\%2 failed. ;Control was stopped due to a fatal error!;Create file new and restart controller
150;14;%4%1: Pressure to low %3 bar at airflow of %2 Nl/min;Pressure to reach the required value is lower than the taught value is;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. 
150;15;%4%1: Pressure to high %3 bar at airflow of %2 Nl/min;Pressure to reach the required value is higher than the taught value is;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly and soiling. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. 
150;16;%4%1: Pressure to high %3 bar at airflow of %2 Nl/min;Pressure to reach the required value is higher than the taught value is;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly and soiling. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. 
150;17;%4%1: Lower pressure limit %3 at air flow %2 Nl/min  ;Pressure to reach the required value is lower than the taught value is;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. 
150;18;%4ContaminationCheck for %1 is not active! ReferenceCheck is not enabled or data is not valid.;The parameter EnableContaminationCheck in the Process.cfg was set to 1, but EnableReferenceCheck is not activated or value table has invalid entries. ;Activate parameter EnableReferenceCheck in process.cfg (3DOnSite) and/or start "Teach reference values".
150;19;%4Device %2 in file %1 not found.;Device not existing in file;Create device
150;20;%4%1 Reference value is invalid because %2 bar is lower than %3 bar. learning failed.;Invalid reference values;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. Teach reference values again.
150;21;%4%1 Reference values invalid;ReferenceCheck activated but reference values not learned and / or invalid.;Teach reference values again or deactivate ReferenceCheck.
150;22;%4Emergency Mode Enabled - %2 in Pressure Mode;AirFlow is working in EmergencyMode;Shutdown of emergency operation in 3DOnSite
150;24;%4%1 Emergency Mode and Accuracy or contamination check active at the same time.;Wrong parameters in process.cfg;Switch off emergency mode or deactivate contamination check and accuracy of airflow.
150;25;%4For device %2, the teaching was ended successfully (%1);Writing of the learned values finished;Function can be used
150;26;%4%1 Emergency Mode and Accuracy or contamination check active at the same time.;Wrong parameters in process.cfg;Deactivation of the emergency mode or turn on reference
150;30;%4Turbine collision speed slump: %1 (max: %2) in %3;No increase in pressure determined in speed controller when main needle is opened. Presumably no bell disk existing.;Please check the fit of the bell disk.
150;31;%4Turbine collision speed slump: %1 (max: %2) in %3;No increase in pressure determined in speed controller when main needle is opened. Presumably no bell disk existing.;Please check the fit of the bell disk.
150;32;%4Turbine collision speed slump: %1 (max: %2) in %3;No increase in pressure determined in speed controller when main needle is opened. Presumably no bell disk existing.;Please check the fit of the bell disk.
150;33;%4references for assigned devices of %1 are not initialized;References for assigned pump and pressure sensors could not be set during initialization. Configuration parameters for p-control / pig-control are invalid;Correct the configuration of P-Control / Pig-Control
150;34;%4%1 Overpressure at controller output. Max. allowed %2 bar;Controller output pressure exceeds allowable pressure.;Check the admission pressure regulator, check the air path (eg. shaping air ring, hose, etc.) after the regulator.
150;35;%4%1 Timeout during learn cycle. Set value = %2 NL/min not reached. Learn cycle failed;Invalid reference values;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. Teach reference values again.
150;36;%4%1 max. pressure = %2 bar reached during learn cycle but min. set value = %3 NL/min. Learn cycle failed;Invalid reference values;Check air cap / shaping air ring for correct assembly. Check all hoses from air volume regulator to air cap / shaping air ring. Teach reference values again.
151;1;%4Error in air heater %1 (%2).;Excess temperature, lower temperature, device defective;Check temperature in the switch cabinet at the control element
