152;100;%4LCC %1 Referencing started.;User information;None
152;101;%4LCC %1 Referencing successfully ended   ;User information;None
152;102;%4LCC %1 Referencing aborted;Due to an error, the referencing has failed.;Eliminate error and start referencing again.
152;103;%4LCC %1 Referencing still active, moving not possible until referencing ends ;Traveling is not possible as long as the referencing is not ended.;Wait until referencing has ended.
152;104;%4LCC %1 PKW channel not free. Init of controller not possible.;The BCU sent a new object to the TriggerBrush (aEvtRxNewBody) but the body ID is 0. The ID must be unequal 0, however.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
152;105;%4LCC %1 Controller not in reference. Please reference. ;1)The controller has not yet been referenced.%CrLf%2)The controller has already been referenced, but there was no bus connection to the SPC200 during the run-up and thus no reference check could be carried out.;1) Reference the controller.%CrLf%2) Restart the control system to repeat the reference test
152;106;%4LCC %1 Timeout when writing on parameter channel;Time-out when writing on the parameter channel.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;107;%4LCC %1 The determined order code for the parameter channel is invalid.;The order code is invalid.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;108;%4LCC %1 Timeout when reading the parameter channel ;No read access to SPC200 controller.%CrLf%- Bus system not ready.%CrLf%- Defect at controller;Check whether bus system is active.%CrLf%If error during run-up, restart control system.%CrLf%Check whether SPC200 controller is defective.
152;109;%4LCC %1 Target position (valve) beyond area min: 1 max: %2 demanded: %3.;Invalid target position.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;110;%4LCC %1 Timeout acknowledgement of movement command;Time-out acknowledging moving task.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;111;%4LCC %1 Timeout target position reached ; Target position not reached within the demanded time.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;112;%4LCC %1 Reached position is not equal to the demanded position actual: %2 required: %3.;The position reported back does not correspond to the demanded position.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;113;%4LCC %1 Parameterized tolerance window too large. Max: %2 mm;The parameter for the tolerance window is too large.;Adjust parameters.
152;114;%4LCC %1 Timeout controller ready;The controller does not report any operativeness within the demanded time.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;115;%4LCC %1 Read back reference table not identical with saved reference table;Reference tables are different.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;116;%4LCC %1 Movement command cannot be executed. Controller not ready. ;The controller is not ready.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;117;%4LCC %1 Movement command cannot be executed. External movement release is missing.;External movement release is missing.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
152;118;%4LCC %1 Movement command cannot be executed. Referencing active.;Referencing not finished yet.;Wait until referencing has ended.
152;119;%4LCC %1 Movement command cannot be executed. Not in reference.;1)The controller has not yet been referenced.%CrLf%2)The controller has already been referenced, but there was no bus connection to the SPC200 during the run-up and thus no reference check could be carried out.;1) Reference the controller.%CrLf%2) Restart the control system to repeat the reference test
