162;3354;%4device%1: New set value %2 is delayed because powering device on/off not yet completed (actual value = %3);With the last set value a power switch on/off was triggered for the high tension device. This process is not yet complete and a new set value is already requested. That's not possible. The new set value is therefore delayed until the power on/off operation is completed.;Consider the charging/discharging times and increase time interval between the brushes.
