166;1;%4MainNeedle switching time at %1 too big. Max: %2 ;When opening and/or closing the main needle with activated feedback, a feedback is expected within the indicated time. An absence and/or a delay of the message has the following causes: Main needle defective, initiator defective, main needle conglutinated, control pressure too low.;1. Change over to manual operation and check main needle and feedback manually %CrLf%2. Clean main needle/atomizer %CrLf%3. Wire and all electric components (check amplifier, fiber optic light cable) %CrLf%4. Check control air pressure
166;2;%4Loss of signal main needle response at %1;The main needle was selected or deselected and the main needle feedback was detected, was lost, however. An omitting of the message has the following causes: main needle defective, initiator defective, main needle conglutinated.;1. Change over to manual operation and check main needle and feedback manually %CrLf%2. Clean main needle/atomizer %CrLf%3. Wire and all electric components (check amplifier, fiber optic light cable) %CrLf%4. Check control air pressure
166;3;%4CO2 beam on %1 not detected. ;The main needle is activated and within the parameterized delay time, no CO2 jet was detected or the CO2 jet was interrupted too long with opened main needle (wobbling).;1. Change over to manual operation and check main needle and feedback manually %CrLf%2. Clean main needle/atomizer %CrLf%3. Wire and all electric components (check amplifier, fiber optic light cable) %CrLf%4. Check control air pressure
166;4;%4No feedback CO2 beam although %1 is not on. ;In spite of closed main needle, a CO2 jet was detected.;1. Change over to manual operation and check main needle and feedback manually %CrLf%2. Clean main needle/atomizer %CrLf%3. Wire and all electric components (check amplifier, fiber optic light cable) %CrLf%4. Check control air pressure
166;5;%4The CO2 sensor of %1 has a hardware error. ;Hardware fault at the CO2 sensor.;1. Change over to manual operation and check main needle and feedback manually %CrLf%2. Clean main needle/atomizer %CrLf%3. Wire and all electric components (check amplifier, fiber optic light cable) %CrLf%4. Check control air pressure
166;10;%4Calculated main needle switching time too small. Limited to %1ms. Calculated %2. ;When calculating the main needle response time, several times (learned time, bus run time, paint distance delay) are used as a basis. The calculated response time must not be any larger than the prewarning time and smaller than 0.;Check the cfg parameter for the bus runtime and the paint distance delay and adjust where appropriate, also, check the main needle response time (learned by means of feedback signal).
166;11;%4Calculated main needle switching time too big. Limited to %1. Calculated %2.;When calculating the main needle response time, several times (learned time, bus run time, paint distance delay) are used as a basis. The calculated response time must not be any larger than the prewarning time and smaller than 0.;Check the cfg parameter for the bus runtime and the paint distance delay and adjust where appropriate, also, check the main needle response time (learned by means of feedback signal).
