186;13;%4%1: Upper alarm limit for mask speed exceeded - required: %2;The indicated upper rotation speed limit for the mask was exceeded. %CrLf%- Changed pneumatic settings%CrLf%- limit values for monitoring not correct%CrLf%- sensor for rotation monitoring faulty%CrLf%- error air drive and/or free movement;Check sensor for rotation monitoring.%CrLf% Check pneumatics (too high air supply for air drive). %CrLf% Check air drive and/or mask for sluggishness.%CrLf% Check parameterization in the 3DOnSite process configuration (file Process.cfg).
186;14;%4%1: Lower alarm limit for mask speed fallen below - required: %2;The indicated lower rotation speed limit for the mask was undershot.%CrLf%- Changed pneumatic settings %CrLf%- limit values for monitoring not correct%CrLf%- sensor for rotation monitoring faulty%CrLf%- error air drive and/ or sluggishness;Check sensor for rotation monitoring.%CrLf% Check pneumatics (none or too small air supply for air drive). %CrLf% Check air drive and/or mask for sluggishness.%CrLf%Parameterization in the 3DOnSite process configuration (file Process.cfg).
