251;100;%4%1: Material temperature (%2) below application range (%3);The material temperature is below the specified (configurable) limit:%CrLf% - System startup (warmup) not yet completed%CrLf% - No circulation%CrLf% - No or low material flow (No heat transfer to the material)%CrLf% - Incorrect parameterization%CrLf% - Faulty sensors%CrLf% - Material deposits in the area of sensor;Identify possible cause and eliminate the fault:%CrLf% - Wait for system start-up/warm-up%CrLf% - Start/check circulation and modify if required%CrLf% - Check parametrization (tolerances of set-values) and correct them if required%CrLf% - Check the sensors%CrLf% - Check the application%CrLf% - Quit all errors%CrLf% - Release inlet-conveyor
