251;200;%4%1: Current set value %2 in calibration table %3 not included ;The demanded required value is not covered by the process and the corresponding calibrating table. %CrLf%- wrong calibrating table selected or invalid required value assigned%CrLf%- calibration not carried out or not successfully carried out;Check required values in brush table as well as override factors and adjust where appropriate. %CrLf%Carry out and check process calibration at the end of program.
252;1;%4%1: Error when creating %2;It was attempted to create the indicated directory. This was not possible, however.%CrLf%- Target path reserved%CrLf%- System-dependent refusal of hard disk access%CrLf%- Internal error%CrLf%;Check the indicated path in the Explorer.
252;2;%4%1: Path %2 is a file and not a directory;When accessing the specified path was determined that this is not a directory but a file.;Check the specified path, or delete the existing file.
252;10;%4%1: Path %2 is a directory and not a file;When accessing the specified path was determined that this is not a file but a directory.;Check the indicated path in the Explorer.
252;20;%4%1: Error when opening or creating %2 ;It was attempted to open and/or create the indicated files. This was not possible, however.%CrLf%- Destination file available, but write-protected%CrLf%- System-dependent refusal of hard disk access%CrLf%;Check the indicated file in the Explorer. Check available memory.
252;30;%4%1: Error when closing %2 ;It was attempted to close the indicated file. This was not possible, however.%CrLf%- Destination file reserved%CrLf%- System-dependent refusal of hard disk access%CrLf%- Internal controller problem;Check the indicated file in the Explorer. Check available memory.
252;31;%4%1: Runtime error when closing %2;It was attempted to close the indicated file. This was not possible, however.%CrLf%- Destination file reserved%CrLf%- System-dependent refusal of hard disk access%CrLf%- Internal controller problem;Check the indicated file in the Explorer. Check available memory.
252;40;%4%1: Error when deleting %2;It was attempted to delete the indicated file. This was not possible, however.%CrLf%- File write-protected%CrLf%- System-dependent refusal of hard disk access%CrLf%;Check the specified file and delete manually if necessary.
252;41;%4%1: Runtime error when deleting %2;It was attempted to delete the indicated file. This was not possible, however.%CrLf%- File write-protected%CrLf%- System-dependent refusal of hard disk access%CrLf%;Check the specified file and delete manually if necessary.
363;1;%4PurgeController: Bypass active;- PurgeController was bypassed;fix cause for bypass and enable purgecontroller
