363;3;%4PurgeController: Overpressure inside the robot too low;- no pressure%CrLf%- robot leaky;- check pressurized air supply%CrLf%- search leaks (open the purge valve to increase air flow and pressure by using the supplementary hand operation)
363;4;%4PurgeController: Overpressure inside the robot too high;- tube not plugged%CrLf%- pressure regulator defect;- check valve (open the purge valve to increase air flow and pressure by using the supplementary hand operation)%CrLf%- check / exchange tube%CrLf%- shorten / exchange tube
