363;226;%4PurgeController: Type of sensor block could not be verified;Controller detected unknown type of sensor block;Replace Sensorblock
363;227;%4PurgeController: Sensor block not found;- sensor module not connected%CrLf%- electrical connection to sensor module defect%CrLf%- sensor module defect;- Check if sensor module is connected%CrLf%- Check electrical connection to sensor module%CrLf%- Replace defect sensor module
