364;3;%4Error when connecting PB diagnosis to master %1  ;During the control startup it was attempted to make a connection to the indicated Profibus master card (Connect). This failed. Causes: master unavailable, master renamed in the IoProfibusMaster.cfg, internal control problem.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
364;4;%4PB slave %1 with address %2 has sent a diagnosis telegram ;The indicated Profibus slave has sent a diagnosis telegram.;Check indicated slave
364;5;%4Error when reading the PB master state ;When reading the status information of the Profibus master card, an error occurred (GetMasterStatus). Causes: master failed, No connection to the master, Internal control problem.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
364;6;%4Wrong data type in of PB diagnosis message. Expected %1 ;A diagnosis telegram was sent from a Profibus slave. The operating system reported this error to the diagnosis software, but the structure of the error report is wrong. Internal control problem.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
364;8;%4Error when reading diagnosis data of PB slave %1;A diagnosis telegram was sent from the indicated Profibus slave. When reading the telegram (GetSlaveDiag) an error occurred. Causes: Slave sent invalid telegram, master lost telegram, Internal control problem.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
364;9;%4Diagnosis message of slave %1 but bootup not ready. Diagnosis messages inconsistent! ;During control startup, the indicated Profibus slave has sent a diagnosis telegram . The initialization of the diagnosis software is not finalized, however, and the message cannot be evaluated.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
364;10;%4Error when reading error data to evaluate in the PB diagnosis ;A diagnosis telegram was sent by a Profibus slave. When trying to read out the error buffer an error occurred (GetError). Internal control problem.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
364;16;%4PB slave %1 with address %2 disturbed ;A Profibus slave has sent a diagnosis telegram and is faulty.;Check indicated slave
364;19;%4Error when reading the type of parameter %1 of the profibus error. ;It was attempted to read the parameter type. Here, an error occurred;Get in contact with control supplier.
364;20;%4Error when reading the parameter %1;It was attempted to read the parameter. Here, an error occurred;Get in contact with control supplier.
364;21;%4Error while initializing profibus diagnostic for gateway %1.;- Missing or unassigned hardware endpoints;Check configuration, possibly recreate, restart control
364;22;%4Fieldbus slave with address %1 on gateway %2 reports an error;Miswiring or hardware defect. %CrLf%Communication fault or bus failure.;* Check wiring and hardware.%CrLf%* Check status of superordinate modules.%CrLf%* Check communication of bus.%CrLf%* Restart hardware and/or bus if necessary.%CrLf%* Restart control, contact control manufacturer if necessary.
364;23;%4Fieldbus fault on gateway %1;Miswiring or hardware defect. %CrLf%Communication fault or bus failure.;* Check wiring and hardware.%CrLf%* Check status of superordinate modules.%CrLf%* Check communication of bus.%CrLf%* Restart hardware and/or bus if necessary.%CrLf%* Restart control, contact control manufacturer if necessary.
365;1;%4Error cooling device %1;- Hardware fault;Exchange hardware of device
365;2;%4Cooling device %1 failed;Circuit breaker 4Q3 de-energized;Check fuse and turn back on
