393;58;%4Start conveyor calibration not possible. Conveyor is running.;The function to measure in the conveyor was activated via the vision system. This is only allowed, however, if the conveyor is standing still.;Stop conveyor
393;59;%4Could not get conveyor data. Conveyor is still running during end of measurement;The measuring end of the function "measure in conveyor" is signalled at the vision system. To carry out this function, the conveyor must be standing still. This was not the case.;Stop conveyor and repeat measurement
393;60;%4Invalid step of incremental encoder. Leap %1 inc. Allowed %2 inc ;Within a control cycle, the change of the actual value of the incremental transmitter or the transmitter card is larger than the permissible change is.;The control was stopped for safety reasons. ATTENTION: Restart the control and clear the cell in T1 by all means since a path continuation is not possible after reset or loss of the counter card (loss of the current conveyor position)
393;61;%4invalid conveyor position for conveyor filter. current %1 inc., min %2 inc., max %3 inc. ;Because of a failure of the incremental transmitter or the transmitter card, an inadmissible actual value resulted. The smoothing (filter) of the actual value cannot be guaranteed anymore.;The control was stopped for safety reasons. ATTENTION: Restart the control and clear the cell in T1 by all means since a path continuation is not possible after reset or loss of the counter card (loss of the current conveyor position)
