399;9;%4The function "Hold Color" was activated at a color with a non-numerical valve.;The function "Hold Color" was activated in the Paint Assignment at a color with a non-numerical color valve (i.e. "?", "-"). The function "Hold Color" can only be used with numerical color valves.;Deactivate the function "Hold Color" in the Paint Assignment at all non-numerical color valves. Save Paint Assigment again.
399;10;%4The function "Hold Color" was activated at multiple color valves.;The function "Hold Color" was activated in the Paint Assignment at multiple color valves. The function "Hold Color" can only be used with max. one color valve.;Activate the function "Hold Color" only at colors of one color valve in the Paint Assigment. Save Paint Assigment again.
