400;1;%4No name for profibus slave entered;For the Profibus slave, a name must be indicated in the parameter FX765A:0/PBDP:0/PBDPSLAVE:0. This name is required to map to the slave.;In the kemro.manager, enter a name for the slave FX765A:0/PBDP:0/PBDPSLAVE:0 and restart control
400;3;%4Error while mapping to profibus slave %1: Code: %2;During control startup an attempt was made to connect to the indicated Profibus slave card (Connect). This failed. Causes: see error code;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
400;4;%4No communication to profibus slave. Code: %2  ;The Profibus slave is not in the data exchange status. Causes: PLC does not communicate, wrong slave address, wire breakage between PLC and EcoRPC, control is not yet ready for communication after restart. ;Check communication with PLC
400;6;%4SCU and PLC must not be active simultaneously, slave bus communication must be separated.;SCU was activated by configuration or automatic Internal, however, the bus slave communication to the PLC still exists. This is an inadmissible operating state.;Deactivate SCU or interrupt bus communication to the PLC.
