498;100;%4Internal controller error (service info:%1);Internal control problem, programming error or parameterizing error.;1. Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service%CrLf%2. Quitt error and try to continue.%CrLf%3. If continuing isn't possible, deselect the atmoizer and try to quitt errors again%CrLf%4. If continuing isn't possible, deselect the robot and try to quitt errors again%CrLf%5. Restart the robot control%CrLf%%CrLf%
498;101;%4Fatal controller error (service info: %1);Internal control problem, programming error or parameterizing error.;1. Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service%CrLf%2. Restart the robot control
498;102;%4Internal controller error (service info: %1);Internal control problem, programming error or parameterizing error.;1. Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service%CrLf%2. Quitt error and try to continue.%CrLf%3. If continuing isn't possible, deselect the atmoizer and try to quitt errors again%CrLf%4. If continuing isn't possible, deselect the robot and try to quitt errors again%CrLf%5. Restart the robot control%CrLf%%CrLf%
