498;2000;%4Error when registering variable %1 at the SWO interface ;At the control startup the devices report variables at the SWO interface (for EcoScreen Softlog and Kemro.Scope). Here, an error occurred.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
498;2001;%4Signal %1 could not be registered at SWO. Signal name too long. ;At the control startup the devices report variables at the SWO interface (for EcoScreen Softlog and Kemro.Scope). The signal name is too long, however. A maximum of 32 signs are permissible.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
498;2002;%4Signal %1 could not be registered at SWO. Unit too long. ;At the control startup the devices report variables at the SWO interface (for EcoScreen Softlog and Kemro.Scope). The text for the unit is too long, however. A maximum of 32 signs are permissible.;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
