513;9;%4Drive %1: drag error ;With the mentioned drive, the difference between required and actual value is larger than the parameterized maximum value.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
513;10;%4Drive %1: Limit switch reached: %2.;The respective drive has activated the mechanical axis limit switch.;Check configuration of the axis end position. File "MachineData.cfg", parameter "minPos" of the affected axis.%CrLf%Align configured values with drive parameter S-0-0050.
513;11;%4Drive %1 has reached positive axis limit switch position %2;The respective drive has activated the mechanical axis limit switch.;Check configuration of the axis end position. File "MachineData.cfg", parameter "maxPos" of the affected axis.%CrLf%Align configured values with drive parameter S0-0049.
513;12;%4Command <set absolute measure> for %1 failed %2. ;Problem in the communication between control and drive control element.;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
513;14;%4Wrong drive status for %1 (necessary: %2) ;The mastering (reference) is not possible with this drive status.;Acknowledge, repeat mastering. Contact the controller supplier if the error should reappear.
