517;1;%4Gripper not defined (%1);In the configuration, the working space monitoring is activated for the jogging ([RC.KINEMATIC:0]jogPointCheckArea = 1). No Gripper points are defined, however, or no coordinate transformation is available for these kinematics.;Check and correct configuration, then restart control.
517;2;%4Reading of MCUReadRampFactor %1 failed. ;Programming error or internal control problem;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
517;3;%4Coordinate system %1 for jogging not set because not all drives are mastered.;As long as not all axes were referenced, a Cartesian traveling cannot be carried out. Jogging is only allowed in axis coordinates.;Reference axes or select the axis coordinate system while jogging.
517;4;%4Lost condition for cartesian jogging (%1).;An error is pending or the drives are not turned on or any axis is not referenced.;Check whether all axes are referenced, acknowledge error and press acknowledge button.
