517;21;%4Insufficient presettings when jogging (%1);Programming error or internal control problem;None
517;22;%4Supplementary presettings were corrected (%1);User information;None
517;23;%4unsymmetrical ramp for jogging path (%1);User information;None
517;24;%4Cartesian jogging not permissible (%1).;An error is pending or the drives are not turned on or any axis is not referenced.;Check whether all axes are referenced, acknowledge error and press acknowledge button.
517;25;%4Reference system for jogging invalid (%1).;No transformation of coordinates is available for this kinematics;Either only jog in axes or check and correct configuration, then restart control.
517;26;%4Reading of the gripper data from the movement generation failed (%1);In the configuration, no gripper points are defined for the working space monitoring.;Check and correct configuration, then restart control.
