521;1;%4Robot has left the safe working area.;The configuration of the safety controller doesn't match with the configuration of the robot.;Verfiy the configration of the safety controller with configuration of the robot.
521;2;%4The robot has exeeded the allowed velocity.;The configuration of the safety controller doesn't match with the configuration of the robot.;Verfiy the configration of the safety controller with configuration of the robot.
521;3;%4The mapping to an virtual in-/output %1 of the safety controller failed.;Project planning error in robot software.;Rework project planning.
521;4;%4Maximum allowed downtime of RPC controller expired, synchronisation of safety controller (SCP) requested.;The RPC controller or it's drives were switched off for a longer time.%CrLf%Because of that the safety controller has to be synchronised.;Run synchronisation movement of the safety controller.
521;5;%Drive %1 is not switched on because of missing safety release signal (STO).;Drive release from station PLC is pending but no release signal from safety controller.;Check cable, plug and contact of the STO wiring of mentioned drive controller.
521;6;%4Timeout or invalid answer from safety controller to commando - %1.;Internal control problem, programming error or parameterizing error.;1. Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service%CrLf%2. Quitt error and try to continue.%CrLf%3. If continuing isn't possible, deselect the atmoizer and try to quitt errors again%CrLf%4. If continuing isn't possible, deselect the robot and try to quitt errors again%CrLf%5. Restart the robot control%CrLf%%CrLf%
521;7;%Robot is in the synchronisationpositon of the safety controller but no signal from iniator received.;- Position of initiator is not correct.%CrLf%- Position of robot is not correct.%CrLf%- Wiring or initiator defect.;- Check position of initiator.%CrLf%- Check position of robot.%CrLf%- Check wiring and function of initiator.
521;8;%4Brake check was not executed successful for more than 6 hours, execute brake check manual.;Brake check wasn't successful but this is necessary to ensure the correct function of the brake.%CrLf%When the test interval is not respected the robot is only allowed to move with safely reduced speed.;Carry out brake test.
521;9;%4Brake check was not executed successful in the last 8 hours, execute brake check manual.;Brake check wasn't successful but this is necessary to ensure the correct function of the brake.%CrLf%When the test interval is not respected the robot is only allowed to move with safely reduced speed.;Carry out brake test.
521;10;%4Brake check was not executed successful for more than 8 hours, move to brake check position in T1 mode.;Brake check wasn't successful but this is necessary to ensure the correct function of the brake.%CrLf%When the test interval is not respected the robot is only allowed to move with safely reduced speed.;Move robot to brake check position in T1 mode and execute brake check.%CrLf%Afterwards execute synchronisation of the saftey control.
521;11;%4 The safety control doesn't offer interface information in required time.;The safety controller isn't in state RUN.;1. Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service%CrLf%2. Restart the robot control
521;12;%4The mapping to an virtual in-/output %1 of the safety controller failed.;Project planning error in robot software.;Rework project planning.
521;13;%4Waiting for interface information of the safety control (SCP).;Pending errors at one of the encoder boxes.%CrLf%Faulty ProfiSafe communication to Station-PLC.%CrLf%The safety controller isn't in state RUN.;- Reset pending error, serveral times if necessary. If the error message could not be acknowledged, wait some time and repeat action.%CrLf%- Respect other error messages and clear disturbances.%CrLf%- Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service.
521;14;%4Mode automatic is not allowed as long as the safety control is not synchronized.;Is the safety control not sychronized the robot isn't allowed to move fast than 250mm/sec.%CrLf%This would lead to a bad application result.%CrLf%Because of that the automatic mode is not allowed in this situation.;Switch station to mode "Hand" and move the robot to fixed position SYNC by EcoScreen.%CrLf%When the robot has reached the position and the signal form the initiator is received, the sychronisation is executed.
521;15;%4Robot in Synchronposition but safety controller is not referenced.;Synchronisation of the safety control not possible because safety cotrol isn't referenced.;- Run reference movement to set reference for safety controller.%CrLf%- Run synchronisation movement of safety controller.
