536;1;%4Vision system configuration does not exist or is faulty;Refer to error text;Check configuration, possibly recreate, restart control
536;2;%4Invalid PLC strobe for shifting values;Problem in the communication between PLC and RC;Acknowledge, in case of repeated occurrence, contact control supplier.
536;4;%4Could not start vision system because no access to field bus;Not all inputs/outputs of the field bus slave could be mapped.%CrLf%Different designation of the hardware end points in the Kemro manager and RCU.%CrLf%one or several inputs/outputs were not created in the Kemro manager.;Check configuration with Kemromgr and align with interface documentation,%CrLf%then restart control.
536;5;%4Communication error Profibus master to vision system ;The vision system reports this error.;Check error messages at the control processor of the vision system.
536;6;%4Communication error robot to vision system ;The vision system reports this error.;Check error messages at the control processor of the vision system.
536;7;%4Error in the feature recognition by the vision system;The vision system reports this error.;Check error messages at the control processor of the vision system.
536;8;%4Wrong or deactivated type or color from vision system ;The vision system reports this error.;Check error messages at the control processor of the vision system.
536;9;%4Measured values beyond tolerance. Error in calculation. ;The vision system reports this error.;Check error messages at the control processor of the vision system.
536;10;%4Image trigger cannot be executed. No access to HW output %1 ;Not all inputs/outputs of the field bus master could be mapped.%CrLf%Different designation of the hardware end points in the Kemro manager and RCU.%CrLf%one or several inputs/outputs were not created in the Kemro manager.;Check configuration with Kemromgr and align with interface documentation,%CrLf%then restart control.
536;11;%4Image trigger cannot be executed. RGS Online not activated. ;In the teach program, the command SETPROCESSCOMMAND(eVisionTrigger, ...) is used although the functionality "TriggeredPicture" in the configuration is not activated;Change configuration and restart control or revise teach program.
536;12;%4Image trigger cannot be executed. Sequence of operation too fast. ;Signal to vision computer is still set when new triggering signal comes;Increase the distance of the trigger points for the commands SETPROCESSCOMMAND(eVisionTrigger...)  in the teach program.
536;13;%4Image trigger cannot be executed. Starting conditions not fulfilled. ;SETPROCESSCOMMAND(eVisionTrigger...)  in the teach program is supposed to be executed although measurement task was not started yet.;In the teach program, start measuring program (SET macro)
536;14;%4Timeout %1 msec: %2 set operating mode to ISRA-RGS;Error in the communication between vision computer and control;Check vision computer and connecting cable.
536;15;%4Timeout %1 msec ProgInfoSequence: Error from ISRA-RGS is pending.;Vision computer reports an error. Process cannot be continued.;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;16;%4Timeout %1 msec: Ready for measurement of ISRA-RGS ;Vision computer is not ready for measurement;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;17;%4Cannot set program number. Error from ISRA-RGS is pending. ;The number of the measurement task cannot be handed over to the vision computer because an error is pending.;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;18;%4Ready for measurement is supplied, although program number was set. ;Error in the communication between vision computer and control;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;19;%4Timeout %1 msec: Starting of measurement at ISRA-RGS ;Error in the communication between vision computer and control;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;20;%4Starting conditions for ISRA-RGS measurement not fulfilled. ;Measuring program on the vision computer was not started.;In the teach program, start measuring program (SET macro)
536;21;%4Errors occurred when measurement was started ;Vision computer reports an error or there are problems in the communication between vision computer and control;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;22;%4Timeout %1 msec: image recording by ISRA-RGS ended;Vision computer reports an error or there are problems in the communication between vision computer and control;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;23;%4Timeout %1 msec: Measurement ended by ISRA-RGS;Vision computer reports an error or there are problems in the communication between vision computer and control;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;24;%4Timeout %1 msec: Transmission of shifting values ;Vision computer reports an error or there are problems in the communication between vision computer and control;Check the error condition at the vision computer.
536;25;%4One or several gap measures beyond tolerance;The clearance check shows that an application is not possible.;Convey car body out without application.
536;26;%4Position values and/or gap values beyond tolerance ;The clearance check shows that an application is not possible.;Convey car body out without application.
536;27;%4Path correction value %1 is too large;The displacing values are outside of the allowed tolerance;Convey car body out without application.
536;28;%4No absolute values for the calculation of relative values available.;No absolute data were read in with RECEIVE(vision, data), before an attempt was made to read in relative data with %CrLf%RECEIVE(VISION_REL, data).;- Check movement program whether the absolute data were read in with RECEIVE(VISION, data) in front of RECEIVE(VISION_REL, data).%CrLf%- Abort movement program, correct and restart.
536;29;%4Vision system type %1 is not supported for the function %2.;Invalid parameterization.;Correct parameter
