548;16;%4EcoTalk program line %1, parameter %2 has invalid value: %3. ;In the file "EcotalkVariables.ttp" the customer can configure the names of the transfer parameters for EcoTalk, %CrLf%the value of the mentioned parameter was changed to invalid value for this function.;Change mentioned parameter in the file "EcotalkVariables.ttp" to valid value and restart control.%CrLf%The range of values of the parameter valid for this function is to be taken from the comment in the file.
