553;12;%4Macro GET is used without the setting "latest possible adherence";The macro GET assumes that the property 'Attach as late as possible' is activated in the control. Then the flow is stopped and branch instructions executed only so late that this is still possible without a speed slump.;In the configuration data for the system, the entry [MC]needNextSegPreDelay must be set to a positive value.
553;13;%4Trigger prewarning time was set to %1 ms ;User information;None
553;14;%4Trigger prewarning time could not be set ;Control was stopped due to a fatal error!;Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
