553;31;%4Gun %1 twice OFF;In the teach program, the main needle is closed twice after each other.;Check teach program and adapt.
553;32;%4WAIT_PAINTPOSITION( %1 ) smaller than last, automatic GunOn/Off not possible.;Current paint position from command "WAIT_paint position" is smaller than the last, because of that it is not possible to switch the main needle automatically at this command. Option switchGunAtWaitPaintPos active. ;Check handed over values of the command "WAIT_PAINTPOSITION" in the movement program.
