553;35;%4EcoTalk command: %2, line: %3 - couldn't be executed without auxiliary joint.;With mentioned command the auxiliary joint should be shifted. This is not possible without an linear auxiliary joint.;Correct EcoTalk command according to EcoTalk Doku and reload teach program.
553;36;%4EcoTalk command: %2, line: %3 - execution isn't allowed while tracking is active.;With mentioned command the auxiliary joint should be shifted. This is not possible while tracking is active.;Correct EcoTalk command according to EcoTalk Doku and reload teach program.
553;37;%4EcoTalk command: %2, line: %3 - The target point is not programmed in Axis.;The stated point is programmed in the wrong coordinate system ;Program mentioned point in the demanded coordinate system
553;38;%4Command %1 couldn't be executed because the process control doesn't offer needed information.;Internal control error (division by zero, invalid array accesses, etc.);Restart control. Contact control supplier if this should occur repeatedly.
553;39;%4Color group %2 which is requested by command %1 isn't configured for Pushout.;The requested color group has to be configured in the Typelist.%CrLf%If movement path is separated by this command, the Pushout-function has to know this special path.;Mentioned color group has to be configured in the Typelist.%CrLf%Please check movement program according EcoTalk documention.
553;40;%4Paint program finished without the usage of command WAIT_PROCESS_READY, this is not allowed.;In the just finished movement program paint commands were used but without checking if paint control is ready before with command WAIT_PROCESS_READY.%CrLf%This is not allowed in Stop&Go mode because the paint quality couldn't be ensured.;Check logical schedule of movement program according EcoTalk documentation.
553;41;%4The process control doesn't send high tension information in requested time.;Internal control problem, programming error or parameterizing error.;1. Use 3DOnSite to create a logfile-collector package and send it to DÜRR-service%CrLf%2. Restart the robot control
553;42;%4More than on fixed position with name "inbox" is found. This is not allowed.;For the calculation of working area -Atomizer in cleaning device- this fixed position point is needed. %CrLf%This point isn't configured unique.;Check fixed position point and restart control.
553;43;%4No fixed position with name %1 is found. This is not allowed.;For the calculation of working area -Atomizer in cleaning device- this fixed position point is needed. %CrLf%This point isn't configured unique.;Check fixed position point and restart control.
553;44;%4Invalid TOOL: Execute program Home to set valid tool / deselect high tension.;For the caluculation of the working area - Atomizer in cleaning device- valid tool data are needed.%CrLf%They are not set probably a restart of controller was done.;- Please execute movement program in which valid tool data were set.%CrLf%  For example the program -Home- form project -Fixpos-%CrLf%- Deselect high tension.
553;45;%4The start tool in the configuration isn't 0. This is not allowed.;For the calcualtion of the working area -Atomizer in cleaning device- a start tool not equal to "0" isn't allowed. But in the configuration a start tool not equal to "0" is configured.;Check and correct configuration, then restart control.
